abstract: >-
  An interactive, literature-grounded 3D visualization of the human
  interstitium and the five fluid systems it physically connects: the
  circulatory, lymphatic, glymphatic, ventricular (CSF), and nervous
  systems. Ships as self-contained desktop and mobile standalone HTML
  builds with click-to-identify parts, flow animation, time-speed
  control, hydration scenarios, and a live constriction/congestion
  assessment panel.
